eriously? If you're surprised can you at least act like it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_27","text":"... Is there really no alternative?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_28","text":"Well... they say if I stay quiet and do nothing, it might be longer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_29","text":"But given the situation, that's not really an option.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_30","text":"You should retire at once and get some rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_31","text":"You know I can't do that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_33","text":"Are you going to tell everyone?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_34","text":"No. I only meant to tell you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_35","text":"How cruel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_36","text":"Well, I suppose it's the fate of the next leader.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_37","text":"You should at least tell Snow White.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_38","text":"Hmm... I don't know if that's the right thing to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_39","text":"Do you want her to endure the same pain twice?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_40","text":"... I'm not sure if that kid can handle it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_41","text":"Snow White's not a kid anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_42","text":"She's grown so much since then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_43","text":"Heh. To me, everyone is still a kid.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_44","text":"Even me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_45","text":"I'm only telling you this because I don't think you are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_46","text":"Sometimes... I wish people would treat me like a kid, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_47","text":"I understand. We all have moments like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_48","text":"Anyway, just keep this in mind. If anything happens, I'll be counting on you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_49","text":"What's there to be so scared of? We've got the Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_50","text":"He's likely going to be the one who breaks down the hardest. He's playing it cool now, but I'm sure of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_51","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_52","text":"Hehe, sorry for dropping all that on you out of nowhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_53","text":"When have you not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_54","text":"So... future leader, what is it you hate so much?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_55","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_56","text":"Myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_57","text":"... Hmm?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_04_e_58","text":"I hate myself. I'm stuck in this loop of self-loathing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_04_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_